 - Bugs in setitem-with-expansion when adding new rows failing to keep the original dtype in some cases (:issue:`32346`, :issue:`15231`, :issue:`47503`, :issue:`6485`, :issue:`25383`, :issue:`52235`, :issue:`17026`, :issue:`56010`)
